    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/433d1b043dc75b320b1e9e405e10faa8.poster.avif?t=1752051975\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/433d1b043dc75b320b1e9e405e10faa8.webm?t=1752051975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><u><strong>A PILGRIMAGE TOWARD REPENTANCE</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on the role of a Ward of Corvus and carve your way through the interconnected islands of the Risacca Archipelago to end the evil consuming this world. Face formidable enemies in epic battles and uncover countless secrets with every new sacrificial attempt.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/910d23e4764c6da2e11711c32635ec97.poster.avif?t=1752051975\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/910d23e4764c6da2e11711c32635ec97.webm?t=1752051975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/910d23e4764c6da2e11711c32635ec97.mp4?t=1752051975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><u><strong>EACH ATTEMPT IS UNIQUE</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Risacca Archipelago is ravaged by tides and corruption. Every run offers the opportunity to explore a new path leading to the ultimate sacrifice. Enemies, chests, and rewards awaiting you will vary with each attempt. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/90a2da086de3227a5bbf8b17434d7fb3.poster.avif?t=1752051975\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/90a2da086de3227a5bbf8b17434d7fb3.webm?t=1752051975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/90a2da086de3227a5bbf8b17434d7fb3.mp4?t=1752051975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>EVERY DECISION MATTERS</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beware, Ward! Every choice you make binds you to your fate. The path to the gate is fraught with traps and deadly encounters. Haste will be your downfall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/b0412a665d6923a07371900712afcd87.poster.avif?t=1752051975\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/b0412a665d6923a07371900712afcd87.webm?t=1752051975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/b0412a665d6923a07371900712afcd87.mp4?t=1752051975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>FORGE YOUR DESTINY</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather and upgrade your weapons and equipment throughout your trials. Accept the blessings of the Embrace and wield its powers to amplify your abilities. Discover countless character builds and configurations as you progress.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/a03c7aed8bfe7046a67836d40c8edeeb.poster.avif?t=1752051975\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/a03c7aed8bfe7046a67836d40c8edeeb.webm?t=1752051975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>A DARK FANTASTIC WORLD</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in a dark fantasy, set in breathtaking environments designed to make your journey as perilous as a voyage through hell itself.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/433d1b043dc75b320b1e9e405e10faa8.poster.avif?t=1752051975\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/433d1b043dc75b320b1e9e405e10faa8.webm?t=1752051975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><u><strong>A PILGRIMAGE TOWARD REPENTANCE</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on the role of a Ward of Corvus and carve your way through the interconnected islands of the Risacca Archipelago to end the evil consuming this world. Face formidable enemies in epic battles and uncover countless secrets with every new sacrificial attempt.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/910d23e4764c6da2e11711c32635ec97.poster.avif?t=1752051975\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/910d23e4764c6da2e11711c32635ec97.webm?t=1752051975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/910d23e4764c6da2e11711c32635ec97.mp4?t=1752051975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><u><strong>EACH ATTEMPT IS UNIQUE</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Risacca Archipelago is ravaged by tides and corruption. Every run offers the opportunity to explore a new path leading to the ultimate sacrifice. Enemies, chests, and rewards awaiting you will vary with each attempt. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/90a2da086de3227a5bbf8b17434d7fb3.poster.avif?t=1752051975\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/90a2da086de3227a5bbf8b17434d7fb3.webm?t=1752051975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/90a2da086de3227a5bbf8b17434d7fb3.mp4?t=1752051975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>EVERY DECISION MATTERS</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beware, Ward! Every choice you make binds you to your fate. The path to the gate is fraught with traps and deadly encounters. Haste will be your downfall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/b0412a665d6923a07371900712afcd87.poster.avif?t=1752051975\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/b0412a665d6923a07371900712afcd87.webm?t=1752051975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/b0412a665d6923a07371900712afcd87.mp4?t=1752051975\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>FORGE YOUR DESTINY</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather and upgrade your weapons and equipment throughout your trials. Accept the blessings of the Embrace and wield its powers to amplify your abilities. Discover countless character builds and configurations as you progress.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/a03c7aed8bfe7046a67836d40c8edeeb.poster.avif?t=1752051975\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1490990/extras/a03c7aed8bfe7046a67836d40c8edeeb.webm?t=1752051975\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>A DARK FANTASTIC WORLD</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself in a dark fantasy, set in breathtaking environments designed to make your journey as perilous as a voyage through hell itself.</p>",
